### Base URL: http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### 1. Create a Resource
POST {{base_url}}/resources
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sample Service",
  "description": "A production-grade standard service"
}

### 2. Get All Resources (Default Pagination)
GET {{base_url}}/resources?pageNumber=0&pageSize=10&sortBy=name&sortDirection=ASC

### 3. Search Resources (Advanced Filtering)
POST {{base_url}}/resources/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pageNumber": 0,
  "pageSize": 10,
  "sortBy": "createdAt",
  "sortDirection": "DESC",
  "filters": [
    {
      "column": "name",
      "operator": "LIKE",
      "value": "Sample"
    }
  ]
}

### 4. Advanced Filtering with Multiple Clauses
POST {{base_url}}/resources/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pageNumber": 0,
  "pageSize": 5,
  "filters": [
    {
      "column": "name",
      "operator": "EQUALS",
      "value": "Sample Service"
    }
  ]
}
